sequenceDiagram
    participant U as React app
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant D as SQLite

    U->>A: POST /auth/login (username, password)
    A->>D: check Argon2 hash, store refresh token hash
    A-->>U: access token (JSON) + Set-Cookie refresh token

    U->>A: GET /history (Bearer access token)
    A-->>U: 200 data

    Note over U,A: 30 min later the access token has expired
    U->>A: GET /history (expired token)
    A-->>U: 401
    U->>A: POST /auth/refresh (cookie + X-Requested-With)
    A->>D: valid? mark old token replaced, store new hash
    A-->>U: new access token + Set-Cookie new refresh token
    U->>A: GET /history (new token), retried once
    A-->>U: 200 data

    Note over U,A: Page reload: memory is empty
    U->>A: POST /auth/refresh (cookie)
    A-->>U: new access token, then GET /auth/me restores the session

    U->>A: POST /auth/logout (cookie)
    A->>D: revoke this sign-in
    A-->>U: 204 + cookie cleared
